WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
You know, you want order in here now,

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.600
yet you stormed the director of Homeland Security,

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.840
Kristi Noem.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.000
You sure didn't have order that day, did you, Senator?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.560
Attorney General, you are under oath.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.320
I did not storm the secretary.

